      "text": "\n\n\n\nAssumptions (What we believe to be true)\n\nThese are the foundational beliefs upon which the project's success rests.\n\n1. Model Size -> 2.0GB (ex.llama-3.2:3b:f_16) - the model also has to be able to use TOOLs, RAM - 5GB\n2. Power to Inference Ratio -> 0.375 w/tk/s (Efficent enough)\n3. Storage technology -> NVMe SSD M.2 64GB\n4. RAM available -> 6G or 4G\n5. Always on\n6. Has no display\n7. Has WiFi 5 and BT 5 and has a unique MAC address\n8. Some have ports some do not\n9. Has an audio interface (Mic and Speakers)\n10. Self contained- can act w/wout internet and can switch between them",
      "fontSize": 32.55757649739583,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\n\n\nAssumptions (What we believe to be true)\n\nThese are the foundational beliefs upon which the project's success rests.\n\n1. Model Size -> 2.0GB (ex.llama-3.2:3b:f_16) - the model also has to be able to use TOOLs, RAM - 5GB\n2. Power to Inference Ratio -> 0.375 w/tk/s (Efficent enough)\n3. Storage technology -> NVMe SSD M.2 64GB\n4. RAM available -> 6G or 4G\n5. Always on\n6. Has no display\n7. Has WiFi 5 and BT 5 and has a unique MAC address\n8. Some have ports some do not\n9. Has an audio interface (Mic and Speakers)\n10. Self contained- can act w/wout internet and can switch between them",
